INSERT INTO `api_file_t` (`tid`,`api_id`,`file_kind`,`file_content`,`created_by`,`updated_by`,`is_del`,`tenant_id`,`file_path`) VALUES ('7ec2c6ba85f944b6b3b169dea47c82b0',NULL,NULL,'{\n  "properties": {},\n  "id": "7ec2c6ba85f944b6b3b169dea47c82b0",\n  "script": null,\n  "groupId": "542f981a013646b6b28446891c2b259e",\n  "name": "01.数据共享情况",\n  "createTime": 1782955343494,\n  "updateTime": 1784437771650,\n  "lock": null,\n  "createBy": null,\n  "updateBy": null,\n  "path": "/data-share",\n  "method": "GET",\n  "parameters": [],\n  "options": [],\n  "requestBody": "{\\n}",\n  "headers": [],\n  "paths": [],\n  "responseBody": "{\\n    \\"code\\": 0,\\n    \\"msg\\": \\"success\\",\\n    \\"success\\": true,\\n    \\"data\\": {\\n        \\"bar1\\": [],\\n        \\"bar2\\": [],\\n        \\"barTable1\\": [],\\n        \\"barTable2\\": []\\n    }\\n}",\n  "description": "资源汇聚情况接口 - 共享部门排行；涉及 rm_org_t 等业务表。",\n  "requestBodyDefinition": null,\n  "responseBodyDefinition": null\n}\n================================\n// 接口：01.数据共享情况\n// 路由：GET /scene/share/data-share\n// 业务说明：资源汇聚情况接口 - 共享部门排行；涉及 rm_org_t 等业务表。\n// 资源汇聚情况接口 - 共享部门排行\n// 路径: /api/dataassets/resourceShareRank\n// 方法: POST\n// 参数: 无\n// 说明: 统计国家级和市级共享部门排行，包括共享库表和共享API总量\n\nimport tenantEs;\nimport \'@/common/configData\' as configData;\n\ntry {\n    // ========== 1. 查询已通过的申请单 ==========\n    var applyDsl = {\n        "size": 1000,\n        "query": {\n            "bool": {\n                "filter": [\n                    { "term": { "flowStatus": 2 } }\n                ]\n            }\n        },\n        "_source": ["catalogIds", "applyOrgId", "applyName", "updatedTime"]\n    };\n    // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n    var applyResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets_apply).search(applyDsl);\n\n    // ========== 2. 收集所有catalogIds和申请机构信息 ==========\n    var allCatalogIdSet = {};  // catalogId -> true（去重）\n    var applyOrgMap = {};      // catalogId -> { orgId, applyName, updatedTime }\n\n    for (hit in applyResult.hits.hits) {\n        var src = hit._source;\n        var catalogIdsStr = src.catalogIds;\n        var applyOrgId = src.applyOrgId;\n        var applyName = src.applyName || \'\';\n        var updatedTime = src.updatedTime || \'\';\n\n        if (!catalogIdsStr || !applyOrgId) { continue; }\n\n        // catalogIds 是逗号分隔的字符串，需要拆分\n        var catalogIds = catalogIdsStr.split(",");\n        for (cid in catalogIds) {\n            var catalogId = cid.trim();\n            if (!catalogId) { continue; }\n\n            allCatalogIdSet[catalogId] = true;\n            applyOrgMap[catalogId] = {\n                orgId: applyOrgId,\n                applyName: applyName,\n                updatedTime: updatedTime\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ========== 3. 查询catalog资产获取目录详情 ==========\n    // 将catalogIds转为数组\n    var catalogIdList = [];\n    for (catalogId in allCatalogIdSet.keySet()) {\n        catalogIdList.push(catalogId);\n    }\n\n    // catalogId -> { catalogName, targetTableId, orgId }\n    var catalogDetailMap = {};\n    var batchSize = 100;\n    var listSize = catalogIdList.size().asInt();\n\n    if (listSize > 0) {\n        // 分批查询catalog资产\n        var batch = 0;\n        var totalBatches = (listSize + batchSize - 1) / batchSize;\n\n        while (batch < totalBatches) {\n            var start = batch * batchSize;\n            var end = start + batchSize;\n            if (end > listSize) { end = listSize; }\n            var batchIds = catalogIdList.subList(start, end);\n\n            var catalogDsl = {\n                "size": 1000,\n                "query": {\n                    "bool": {\n                        "filter": [\n                            { "term": { "assetType": "catalog" } },\n                            { "terms": { "tid": batchIds } }\n                        ]\n                    }\n                },\n                "_source": ["tid", "catalogName", "targetTableId", "orgId", "updatedTime"]\n            };\n            // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n            var catalogResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(catalogDsl);\n\n            for (hit in catalogResult.hits.hits) {\n                var src = hit._source;\n                catalogDetailMap[src.tid] = {\n                    catalogName: src.catalogName || \'\',\n                    targetTableId: src.targetTableId || \'\',\n                    orgId: src.orgId || \'\',\n                    updatedTime: src.updatedTime || \'\'\n                };\n            }\n\n            batch = batch + 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ========== 4. 统计每个机构的共享库表数量 ==========\n    // 共享库表：catalog有targetTableId\n    var orgTableStats = {};  // orgId -> { tableCount, catalogNames, latestUpdateTime }\n\n    for (catalogId in applyOrgMap.keySet()) {\n        var applyInfo = applyOrgMap[catalogId];\n        var catalogDetail = catalogDetailMap[catalogId];\n\n        if (!catalogDetail) { continue; }\n\n        var orgId = applyInfo.orgId;\n        var catalogName = catalogDetail.catalogName;\n        var targetTableId = catalogDetail.targetTableId;\n        var updatedTime = applyInfo.updatedTime || catalogDetail.updatedTime || \'\';\n\n        if (!orgTableStats[orgId]) {\n            orgTableStats[orgId] = {\n                tableCount: 0,\n                catalogNames: [],\n                latestUpdateTime: \'\'\n            };\n        }\n\n        // catalog有targetTableId表示汇聚了库表，即为共享库表\n        if (targetTableId && targetTableId != \'\') {\n            orgTableStats[orgId].tableCount = orgTableStats[orgId].tableCount + 1;\n        }\n\n        // 收集目录名称（最多3个）\n        if (catalogName && orgTableStats[orgId].catalogNames.size() < 3) {\n            var alreadyExists = false;\n            for (name in orgTableStats[orgId].catalogNames) {\n                if (name == catalogName) { alreadyExists = true; break; }\n            }\n            if (!alreadyExists) {\n                orgTableStats[orgId].catalogNames.push(catalogName);\n            }\n        }\n\n        // 更新最新时间\n        if (updatedTime > orgTableStats[orgId].latestUpdateTime) {\n            orgTableStats[orgId].latestUpdateTime = updatedTime;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ========== 5. 查询共享API（通过catalogId关联） ==========\n    // 共享API：申请单catalogIds匹配api.catalogId\n    var orgApiStats = {};  // orgId -> { apiCount }\n\n    if (listSize > 0) {\n        var batch = 0;\n        var totalBatches = (listSize + batchSize - 1) / batchSize;\n\n        while (batch < totalBatches) {\n            var start = batch * batchSize;\n            var end = start + batchSize;\n            if (end > listSize) { end = listSize; }\n            var batchIds = catalogIdList.subList(start, end);\n\n            var apiDsl = {\n                "size": 1000,\n                "query": {\n                    "bool": {\n                        "filter": [\n                            { "term": { "assetType": "api" } },\n                            { "terms": { "catalogId": batchIds } }\n                        ]\n                    }\n                },\n                "_source": ["catalogId", "orgId"]\n            };\n            // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n            var apiResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(apiDsl);\n\n            for (hit in apiResult.hits.hits) {\n                var src = hit._source;\n                var orgId = src.orgId;\n\n                if (!orgId) { continue; }\n\n                // 通过catalogId找到对应的申请机构\n                var catalogId = src.catalogId;\n                var applyInfo = applyOrgMap[catalogId];\n                if (applyInfo) {\n                    orgId = applyInfo.orgId;  // 使用申请机构的orgId\n                }\n\n                if (!orgApiStats[orgId]) {\n                    orgApiStats[orgId] = { apiCount: 0 };\n                }\n                orgApiStats[orgId].apiCount = orgApiStats[orgId].apiCount + 1;\n            }\n\n            batch = batch + 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ========== 6. 查询组织机构信息 ==========\n    // 横向厅局的顶级组织ID\n    var horizontalOrgIds = [\'2067073568296509440\', \'2067073520506609664\'];\n    // 局内数据对外共享的顶级组织ID\n    var internalOrgIds = [\'2057658733680787457\', \'2058490433772060673\'];\n\n    // 查询所有nature=2（部门）的组织\n    var orgList = db.table("rm_org_t")\n        .where().eq("nature", 2).eq("deleted", 0)\n        .select();\n\n    // 构建组织映射：orgId -> { name, parentId }\n    var orgMap = {};\n    for (org in orgList) {\n        orgMap[org.id] = {\n            name: org.name,\n            parentId: org.parentId\n        };\n    }\n\n    // 判断部门属于哪个顶级组织（递归向上查找）\n    var findTopOrg = (orgId, depth) => {\n        if (depth > 10 || !orgId || !orgMap[orgId]) { return null; }\n\n        var parentId = orgMap[orgId].parentId;\n\n        // 检查父级是否是顶级组织\n        for (topId in horizontalOrgIds) {\n            if (parentId == topId) { return topId; }\n        }\n        for (topId in internalOrgIds) {\n            if (parentId == topId) { return topId; }\n        }\n\n        // 递归向上查找\n        return findTopOrg(parentId, depth + 1);\n    };\n\n    var getTopOrgId = (orgId) => {\n        // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n        return findTopOrg(orgId, 0);\n    };\n\n    // ========== 7. 合并统计并分类 ==========\n    var allOrgIds = {};\n    for (orgId in orgTableStats.keySet()) { allOrgIds[orgId] = true; }\n    for (orgId in orgApiStats.keySet()) { allOrgIds[orgId] = true; }\n\n    var horizontalStats = [];\n    var internalStats = [];\n\n    for (orgId in allOrgIds.keySet()) {\n        var tableStats = orgTableStats[orgId];\n        var apiStats = orgApiStats[orgId];\n        var orgInfo = orgMap[orgId];\n\n        if (!orgInfo) { continue; }\n\n        var tableCount = tableStats ? tableStats.tableCount : 0;\n        var apiCount = apiStats ? apiStats.apiCount : 0;\n        var catalogNames = tableStats ? tableStats.catalogNames : [];\n        var latestUpdateTime = tableStats ? tableStats.latestUpdateTime : \'\';\n\n        var topOrgId = getTopOrgId(orgId);\n        var organName = orgInfo.name;\n        var sourceSystem = catalogNames.size() > 0 ? catalogNames[0] : \'\';\n\n        var item = {\n            organName: organName,\n            count1: tableCount,\n            count2: apiCount,\n            sourceSystem: sourceSystem,\n            updateTime: latestUpdateTime\n        };\n\n        // 判断属于哪个顶级组织\n        var isHorizontal = false;\n        for (topId in horizontalOrgIds) {\n            if (topOrgId == topId) { isHorizontal = true; break; }\n        }\n\n        if (isHorizontal) {\n            horizontalStats.push(item);\n        } else {\n            var isInternal = false;\n            for (topId in internalOrgIds) {\n                if (topOrgId == topId) { isInternal = true; break; }\n            }\n            if (isInternal) {\n                internalStats.push(item);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ========== 8. 排序并截取 ==========\n    // 确保count1和count2是数字类型，使用asInt()转换\n    horizontalStats = horizontalStats.sort((a, b) => {\n        // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n        return (b.count1.asInt() + b.count2.asInt()) - (a.count1.asInt() + a.count2.asInt());\n    });\n    internalStats = internalStats.sort((a, b) => {\n        // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n        return (b.count1.asInt() + b.count2.asInt()) - (a.count1.asInt() + a.count2.asInt());\n    });\n\n    var bar1Limit = horizontalStats.size() >= 8 ? 8 : horizontalStats.size();\n    var bar2Limit = internalStats.size() >= 5 ? 5 : internalStats.size();\n\n    var bar1 = horizontalStats.subList(0, bar1Limit);\n    var bar2 = internalStats.subList(0, bar2Limit);\n\n    var barTable1Limit = horizontalStats.size() >= 13 ? 13 : horizontalStats.size();\n    var barTable2Limit = internalStats.size() >= 8 ? 8 : internalStats.size();\n\n    var barTable1 = horizontalStats.subList(0, barTable1Limit);\n    var barTable2 = internalStats.subList(0, barTable2Limit);\n\n    // ========== 9. 格式化返回数据 ==========\n    var formatBar = (list) => {\n        var result = [];\n        for (item in list) {\n            result.push({\n                organName: item.organName,\n                count1: item.count1.asInt(),\n                count2: item.count2.asInt()\n            });\n        }\n        // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n        return result;\n    };\n\n    var formatTable = (list) => {\n        var result = [];\n        for (item in list) {\n            result.push({\n                organName: item.organName,\n                sourceSystem: item.sourceSystem,\n                count1: item.count1.asInt(),\n                count2: item.count2.asInt(),\n                updateTime: item.updateTime\n            });\n        }\n        // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n        return result;\n    };\n\n    // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n    return {\n        bar1: formatBar(bar1),\n        bar2: formatBar(bar2),\n        barTable1: formatTable(barTable1),\n        barTable2: formatTable(barTable2)\n    };\n\n} catch(e) {\n    // 参数或业务状态不满足要求时立即终止请求。\n    exit 500, \'查询资源汇聚情况失败: \' + e.message;\n}\n',NULL,NULL,0,'2084109831678504960','/magic-api/api/08.数据全景/02.数据开放层/01.数据共享情况.ms');
INSERT INTO `api_file_t` (`tid`,`api_id`,`file_kind`,`file_content`,`created_by`,`updated_by`,`is_del`,`tenant_id`,`file_path`) VALUES ('2231eb40aa364f73952adc343ce38566',NULL,NULL,'{\n  "properties": {},\n  "id": "2231eb40aa364f73952adc343ce38566",\n  "script": null,\n  "groupId": "542f981a013646b6b28446891c2b259e",\n  "name": "02.数据应用成效",\n  "createTime": 1782955343504,\n  "updateTime": 1784437771656,\n  "lock": null,\n  "createBy": null,\n  "updateBy": null,\n  "path": "/data-application",\n  "method": "GET",\n  "parameters": [],\n  "options": [],\n  "requestBody": "{\\n}",\n  "headers": [],\n  "paths": [],\n  "responseBody": "{\\n    \\"code\\": 0,\\n    \\"msg\\": \\"success\\",\\n    \\"success\\": true,\\n    \\"data\\": {\\n        \\"organCatalogCount\\": {\\n            \\"gjCount\\": 2,\\n            \\"sjCount\\": 3,\\n            \\"bmCount\\": 50\\n        },\\n        \\"organDemandCount\\": {\\n            \\"gjCount\\": 0,\\n            \\"sjCount\\": 0,\\n            \\"bmCount\\": 0\\n        },\\n        \\"organShareCatalogRank\\": [\\n            {\\n                \\"categoryName\\": \\"标准库_浮标数据(DWD_DISAS_PRE_BUOY_DATA)\\",\\n                \\"catalogCount\\": 1\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"categoryName\\": \\"FBYZT_SJ_BHJQ(FBYZT_SJ_BHJQ)\\",\\n                \\"catalogCount\\": 1\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"categoryName\\": \\"海洋经济处_资源服务目录\\",\\n                \\"catalogCount\\": 1\\n            }\\n        ],\\n        \\"organShareApplyRank\\": [\\n            {\\n                \\"applyOrgName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"applyCount\\": 1\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"applyOrgName\\": \\"海洋经济处\\",\\n                \\"applyCount\\": 1\\n            }\\n        ]\\n    }\\n}",\n  "description": "汇总当前租户的数据目录订阅和应用使用情况，返回数据应用成效大屏指标。",\n  "requestBodyDefinition": null,\n  "responseBodyDefinition": null\n}\n================================\n// 接口：02.数据应用成效\n// 路由：GET /scene/share/data-application\n// 业务说明：汇总当前租户的数据目录订阅和应用使用情况，返回数据应用成效大屏指标。\n// 数据应用成效总览接口\n// 路径: /api/dataassets/dataApplyOverview\n// 方法: POST\n// 参数: 无\n// 说明:\n//   organCatalogCount  - 订阅申请统计（type=catalogSubscribe）\n//     gjCount = 写死为 8\n//     sjCount = 被订阅申请的目录数\n//     bmCount = 被订阅申请的目录的挂接表的字段总数（sum fieldCount）\n//   organDemandCount   - 需求申请统计（type=need）\n//     gjCount = 被需求申请的目录的应用系统数（去重 appId）\n//     sjCount = 被需求申请的目录数\n//     bmCount = 被需求申请的目录的挂接表的字段总数（sum fieldCount）\n//   organShareCatalogRank - 目录被申请次数排行Top10\n//   organShareApplyRank   - 部门目录被申请次数排行Top10\n\nimport tenantEs;\nimport \'@/common/configData\' as configData;\n\ntry {\n\n    // ========== 1. 查询订阅申请单和需求申请单，收集 catalogIds ==========\n    // 订阅申请\n    var subscribeDsl = {\n        "size": 1000,\n        "query": {\n            "bool": {\n                "filter": [\n                    { "term": { "type": "catalogSubscribe" } },\n                    { "term": { "flowStatus": 2 } }\n                ]\n            }\n        },\n        "_source": ["catalogIds"]\n    };\n    // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n    var subscribeResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets_apply).search(subscribeDsl);\n\n    var subscribeCatalogIds = [];\n    for (hit in subscribeResult.hits.hits) {\n        var src = hit._source;\n        if (!src.catalogIds) { continue; }\n        var ids = src.catalogIds.split(",");\n        for (cid in ids) {\n            var trimmed = cid.trim();\n            if (trimmed) { subscribeCatalogIds.push(trimmed); }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 需求申请\n    var needDsl = {\n        "size": 1000,\n        "query": {\n            "bool": {\n                "filter": [\n                    { "term": { "type": "need" } },\n                    { "term": { "flowStatus": 2 } }\n                ]\n            }\n        },\n        "_source": ["catalogIds"]\n    };\n    // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n    var needResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets_apply).search(needDsl);\n\n    var needCatalogIds = [];\n    for (hit in needResult.hits.hits) {\n        var src = hit._source;\n        if (!src.catalogIds) { continue; }\n        var ids = src.catalogIds.split(",");\n        for (cid in ids) {\n            var trimmed = cid.trim();\n            if (trimmed) { needCatalogIds.push(trimmed); }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ========== 2. 合并所有 catalogIds，批量查 catalog 资产 ==========\n    // 收集去重的 catalogIds\n    var allCatalogIdSet = {};\n    for (cid in subscribeCatalogIds) { allCatalogIdSet[cid] = true; }\n    for (cid in needCatalogIds) { allCatalogIdSet[cid] = true; }\n    var allCatalogIds = [];\n    for (cid in allCatalogIdSet.keySet()) { allCatalogIds.push(cid); }\n\n    // catalogId -> { appId, targetTableId }\n    var catalogInfoMap = {};\n    if (allCatalogIds.size().asInt() > 0) {\n        var catBatchSize = 100;\n        var catTotal = allCatalogIds.size().asInt();\n        var catBatch = 0;\n        var catBatches = (catTotal + catBatchSize - 1) / catBatchSize;\n\n        while (catBatch < catBatches) {\n            var start = catBatch * catBatchSize;\n            var end = start + catBatchSize;\n            if (end > catTotal) { end = catTotal; }\n            var batchIds = allCatalogIds.subList(start, end);\n\n            var catDsl = {\n                "size": 1000,\n                "query": {\n                    "bool": {\n                        "filter": [\n                            { "term": { "assetType": "catalog" } },\n                            { "terms": { "tid": batchIds } }\n                        ]\n                    }\n                },\n                "_source": ["tid", "appId", "targetTableId"]\n            };\n            // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n            var catResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(catDsl);\n\n            for (hit in catResult.hits.hits) {\n                var src = hit._source;\n                catalogInfoMap[src.tid] = {\n                    appId: src.appId || \'\',\n                    targetTableId: src.targetTableId || \'\'\n                };\n            }\n            catBatch = catBatch + 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ========== 3. 计算订阅申请的 gjCount/sjCount/bmCount ==========\n    // sjCount = 被订阅申请的目录数\n    var subSjCount = subscribeCatalogIds.size().asInt();\n\n    // gjCount = 被订阅申请的目录的应用系统数（去重 appId）\n    var subAppIdSet = {};\n    for (cid in subscribeCatalogIds) {\n        var info = catalogInfoMap[cid];\n        if (info && info.appId) { subAppIdSet[info.appId] = true; }\n    }\n    var subGjCount = subAppIdSet.keySet().size().asInt();\n\n    // bmCount = 被订阅申请的目录的挂接表的字段总数\n    // 收集 targetTableIds\n    var subTableIds = [];\n    for (cid in subscribeCatalogIds) {\n        var info = catalogInfoMap[cid];\n        if (info && info.targetTableId) { subTableIds.push(info.targetTableId); }\n    }\n\n    var subBmCount = 0;\n    if (subTableIds.size().asInt() > 0) {\n        // 去重\n        var subTableIdSet = {};\n        for (tid in subTableIds) { subTableIdSet[tid] = true; }\n        var uniqueSubTableIds = [];\n        for (tid in subTableIdSet.keySet()) { uniqueSubTableIds.push(tid); }\n\n        var fieldBatchSize = 100;\n        var fieldTotal = uniqueSubTableIds.size().asInt();\n        var fieldBatch = 0;\n        var fieldBatches = (fieldTotal + fieldBatchSize - 1) / fieldBatchSize;\n\n        while (fieldBatch < fieldBatches) {\n            var fStart = fieldBatch * fieldBatchSize;\n            var fEnd = fStart + fieldBatchSize;\n            if (fEnd > fieldTotal) { fEnd = fieldTotal; }\n            var fBatchIds = uniqueSubTableIds.subList(fStart, fEnd);\n\n            var fieldDsl = {\n                "size": 1000,\n                "query": {\n                    "bool": {\n                        "filter": [\n                            { "term": { "assetType": "table" } },\n                            { "terms": { "_id": fBatchIds } }\n                        ]\n                    }\n                },\n                "_source": ["fieldCount"]\n            };\n            // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n            var fieldResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(fieldDsl);\n\n            for (hit in fieldResult.hits.hits) {\n                var src = hit._source;\n                if (src.fieldCount) {\n                    subBmCount = subBmCount + src.fieldCount.asInt();\n                }\n            }\n            fieldBatch = fieldBatch + 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ========== 4. 计算需求申请的 gjCount/sjCount/bmCount ==========\n    var needSjCount = needCatalogIds.size().asInt();\n\n    var needAppIdSet = {};\n    for (cid in needCatalogIds) {\n        var info = catalogInfoMap[cid];\n        if (info && info.appId) { needAppIdSet[info.appId] = true; }\n    }\n    var needGjCount = needAppIdSet.keySet().size().asInt();\n\n    var needTableIds = [];\n    for (cid in needCatalogIds) {\n        var info = catalogInfoMap[cid];\n        if (info && info.targetTableId) { needTableIds.push(info.targetTableId); }\n    }\n\n    var needBmCount = 0;\n    if (needTableIds.size().asInt() > 0) {\n        var needTableIdSet = {};\n        for (tid in needTableIds) { needTableIdSet[tid] = true; }\n        var uniqueNeedTableIds = [];\n        for (tid in needTableIdSet.keySet()) { uniqueNeedTableIds.push(tid); }\n\n        var nFieldBatchSize = 100;\n        var nFieldTotal = uniqueNeedTableIds.size().asInt();\n        var nFieldBatch = 0;\n        var nFieldBatches = (nFieldTotal + nFieldBatchSize - 1) / nFieldBatchSize;\n\n        while (nFieldBatch < nFieldBatches) {\n            var nfStart = nFieldBatch * nFieldBatchSize;\n            var nfEnd = nfStart + nFieldBatchSize;\n            if (nfEnd > nFieldTotal) { nfEnd = nFieldTotal; }\n            var nfBatchIds = uniqueNeedTableIds.subList(nfStart, nfEnd);\n\n            var nFieldDsl = {\n                "size": 1000,\n                "query": {\n                    "bool": {\n                        "filter": [\n                            { "term": { "assetType": "table" } },\n                            { "terms": { "_id": nfBatchIds } }\n                        ]\n                    }\n                },\n                "_source": ["fieldCount"]\n            };\n            // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n            var nFieldResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(nFieldDsl);\n\n            for (hit in nFieldResult.hits.hits) {\n                var src = hit._source;\n                if (src.fieldCount) {\n                    needBmCount = needBmCount + src.fieldCount.asInt();\n                }\n            }\n            nFieldBatch = nFieldBatch + 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ========== 4. 查询所有已通过的目录订阅申请单，统计catalogId被申请次数 + 归属部门被申请次数 ==========\n    var applyDsl = {\n        "size": 1000,\n        "query": {\n            "bool": {\n                "filter": [\n                    { "term": { "type": "catalogSubscribe" } },\n                    { "term": { "flowStatus": 2 } }\n                ]\n            }\n        },\n        "_source": ["catalogIds"]\n    };\n    // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n    var applyResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets_apply).search(applyDsl);\n\n    // 统计每个catalogId被申请的次数\n    var catalogApplyCountMap = {};  // catalogId -> applyCount\n\n    for (hit in applyResult.hits.hits) {\n        var src = hit._source;\n        var catalogIdsStr = src.catalogIds;\n        if (!catalogIdsStr) { continue; }\n\n        var catalogIds = catalogIdsStr.split(",");\n        for (cid in catalogIds) {\n            var catalogId = cid.trim();\n            if (!catalogId) { continue; }\n\n            if (!catalogApplyCountMap[catalogId]) {\n                catalogApplyCountMap[catalogId] = 0;\n            }\n            catalogApplyCountMap[catalogId] = catalogApplyCountMap[catalogId] + 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 收集所有涉及的catalogId，批量查catalog资产获取 catalogName 和 orgId\n    var involvedCatalogIds = [];\n    for (cid in catalogApplyCountMap.keySet()) {\n        involvedCatalogIds.push(cid);\n    }\n\n    // catalogId -> { catalogName, orgId }\n    var catalogInfoMap = {};\n    var invListSize = involvedCatalogIds.size().asInt();\n\n    if (invListSize > 0) {\n        var batchSize = 100;\n        var batch = 0;\n        var totalBatches = (invListSize + batchSize - 1) / batchSize;\n\n        while (batch < totalBatches) {\n            var start = batch * batchSize;\n            var end = start + batchSize;\n            if (end > invListSize) { end = invListSize; }\n            var batchIds = involvedCatalogIds.subList(start, end);\n\n            var catInfoDsl = {\n                "size": 1000,\n                "query": {\n                    "bool": {\n                        "filter": [\n                            { "term": { "assetType": "catalog" } },\n                            { "terms": { "tid": batchIds } }\n                        ]\n                    }\n                },\n                "_source": ["tid", "catalogName", "orgId"]\n            };\n            // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n            var catInfoResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(catInfoDsl);\n\n            for (hit in catInfoResult.hits.hits) {\n                var src = hit._source;\n                catalogInfoMap[src.tid] = {\n                    catalogName: src.catalogName || src.tid,\n                    orgId: src.orgId || \'\'\n                };\n            }\n\n            batch = batch + 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 组装 organShareCatalogRank：每个catalog被申请次数，取Top10\n    var catalogRankList = [];\n    for (catalogId in catalogApplyCountMap.keySet()) {\n        var info = catalogInfoMap[catalogId];\n        var catName = info ? info.catalogName : catalogId;\n        catalogRankList.push({\n            categoryName: catName,\n            catalogCount: catalogApplyCountMap[catalogId],\n            _sort: catalogApplyCountMap[catalogId]\n        });\n    }\n    catalogRankList = catalogRankList.sort((a, b) => b._sort.asInt() - a._sort.asInt());\n    var catRankLimit = catalogRankList.size().asInt() >= 10 ? 10 : catalogRankList.size().asInt();\n    var organShareCatalogRank = [];\n    var catIdx = 0;\n    for (item in catalogRankList) {\n        if (catIdx >= catRankLimit) { break; }\n        organShareCatalogRank.push({\n            categoryName: item.categoryName,\n            catalogCount: item.catalogCount.asInt()\n        });\n        catIdx = catIdx + 1;\n    }\n\n    // 组装 organShareApplyRank：按catalog归属部门统计被申请总次数，取Top10\n    var orgApplyCountMap = {};  // orgId -> count\n    for (catalogId in catalogApplyCountMap.keySet()) {\n        var info = catalogInfoMap[catalogId];\n        if (!info || !info.orgId) { continue; }\n\n        var orgId = info.orgId;\n        if (!orgApplyCountMap[orgId]) {\n            orgApplyCountMap[orgId] = 0;\n        }\n        orgApplyCountMap[orgId] = orgApplyCountMap[orgId] + catalogApplyCountMap[catalogId];\n    }\n\n    // 排序取Top10\n    var orgRankList = [];\n    for (orgId in orgApplyCountMap.keySet()) {\n        orgRankList.push({ orgId: orgId, applyCount: orgApplyCountMap[orgId] });\n    }\n    orgRankList = orgRankList.sort((a, b) => b.applyCount.asInt() - a.applyCount.asInt());\n    var orgRankLimit = orgRankList.size().asInt() >= 10 ? 10 : orgRankList.size().asInt();\n    var top10OrgIds = [];\n    var orgIdx = 0;\n    for (item in orgRankList) {\n        if (orgIdx >= orgRankLimit) { break; }\n        top10OrgIds.push(item.orgId);\n        orgIdx = orgIdx + 1;\n    }\n\n    // 查询机构名称\n    var orgNameMap = {};\n    if (top10OrgIds.size() > 0) {\n        // 从 MySQL 业务表读取当前有效数据。\n        var orgList = db.table("rm_org_t")\n            .where().in("id", top10OrgIds)\n            .select();\n        for (org in orgList) {\n            orgNameMap[org.id] = org.name;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 组装结果（保持排序）\n    var organShareApplyRank = [];\n    for (item in orgRankList) {\n        if (organShareApplyRank.size().asInt() >= orgRankLimit) { break; }\n        var orgId = item.orgId;\n        var orgName = orgNameMap[orgId] ? orgNameMap[orgId] : orgId;\n        organShareApplyRank.push({\n            applyOrgName: orgName,\n            applyCount: item.applyCount.asInt()\n        });\n    }\n\n    // ========== 返回结果 ==========\n    return {\n        organCatalogCount: {\n            gjCount: 8,\n            sjCount: subSjCount,\n            bmCount: subBmCount\n        },\n        organDemandCount: {\n            gjCount: needGjCount,\n            sjCount: needSjCount,\n            bmCount: needBmCount\n        },\n        organShareCatalogRank: organShareCatalogRank,\n        organShareApplyRank: organShareApplyRank\n    };\n\n} catch(e) {\n    // 参数或业务状态不满足要求时立即终止请求。\n    exit 500, \'查询数据应用成效失败: \' + e.message;\n}\n',NULL,NULL,0,'2084109831678504960','/magic-api/api/08.数据全景/02.数据开放层/02.数据应用成效.ms');
INSERT INTO `api_file_t` (`tid`,`api_id`,`file_kind`,`file_content`,`created_by`,`updated_by`,`is_del`,`tenant_id`,`file_path`) VALUES ('7634052f946c41c3b35a4cae37623eb7',NULL,NULL,'{\n  "properties": {},\n  "id": "7634052f946c41c3b35a4cae37623eb7",\n  "script": null,\n  "groupId": "542f981a013646b6b28446891c2b259e",\n  "name": "03.资源汇聚分页",\n  "createTime": 1782955343515,\n  "updateTime": 1784437771661,\n  "lock": null,\n  "createBy": null,\n  "updateBy": null,\n  "path": "/data-collect-page",\n  "method": "POST",\n  "parameters": [],\n  "options": [],\n  "requestBody": "{\\n    \\"queryType\\": 0,\\n    \\"pageNum\\": 1,\\n    \\"pageSize\\": 20\\n}",\n  "headers": [],\n  "paths": [],\n  "responseBody": "{\\n    \\"code\\": 0,\\n    \\"msg\\": \\"success\\",\\n    \\"success\\": true,\\n    \\"data\\": {\\n        \\"total\\": 83,\\n        \\"pageNum\\": 1,\\n        \\"pageSize\\": 10,\\n        \\"list\\": [\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"标准库_重点渔船\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"海上福建数据专区标准库\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"标准库_重点渔船(DWD_SHIP_PORT_KEY_VESSEL_INFO)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 295\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"资产数据表(父表)\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"福建省渔船动态监控管理系统mysql\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"资产数据目录(父表)(da_asset_t)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 2167\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"船舶所有权信息\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 127401\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"标准库_浮标数据_目标表\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"达梦_TEST\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"标准库_浮标数据(DWD_DISAS_PRE_BUOY_DATA)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 11\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"基本表_海上船舶\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"海上福建数据专区标准库\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"基本目录_海上船舶(DWD_SHIP_PORT_SEA_SHIP_DTL)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 108516\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"标准库_浮标海洋环境浮标次表层流数据_观测网\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"HSFJ达梦\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"标准库_浮标海洋环境浮标次目录层流数据_观测网(DWD_DISAS_PRE_GC_BUOY_SURFACE_CURR_DTL)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 0\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"标准表_执法案件信息表\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 0\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"标准库_地波雷达观测信息\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"标准库_地波雷达观测信息(DWD_DISAS_PRE_GROUND_OBSERVE_INFO)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 0\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"FBYZT_SJ_BHJQ(FBYZT_SJ_BHJQ)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 0\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"标准库_浮标海洋环境浮标次表层流数据_观测网\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"海上福建数据专区标准库\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"标准库_浮标海洋环境浮标次目录层流数据_观测网(DWD_DISAS_PRE_GC_BUOY_SURFACE_CURR_DTL)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 0\\n            }\\n        ]\\n    }\\n}",\n  "description": "按局内或局外来源及页面条件读取机构汇聚资料，返回资源汇聚列表与分页总数。",\n  "requestBodyDefinition": null,\n  "responseBodyDefinition": null\n}\n================================\n// 接口：03.资源汇聚分页\n// 路由：POST /scene/share/data-collect-page\n// 业务说明：按局内或局外来源及页面条件读取机构汇聚资料，返回资源汇聚列表与分页总数。\n// 资源汇聚情况 - 分页接口\n// 三个表格的分页查询接口\n\nimport tenantEs;\nimport \'@/common/configData\' as configData;\n\n// ========== 通用工具函数 ==========\n\n// 批量查询组织名称\nvar queryOrgNames = (orgIdList) => {\n    var orgNameMap = {};\n    if (orgIdList.size().asInt() > 0) {\n        // 从 MySQL 业务表读取当前有效数据。\n        var orgList = db.table("rm_org_t")\n            .where().in("id", orgIdList)\n            .select();\n        for (org in orgList) {\n            orgNameMap[org.id] = org.name;\n        }\n    }\n    // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n    return orgNameMap;\n};\n\n// 批量查询db信息\nvar queryDbNames = (dbIdList) => {\n    var dbMap = {};\n    for (dbId in dbIdList) {\n        var dbDsl = {\n            "size": 1,\n            "query": { "term": { "id": dbId } },\n            "_source": ["dbName"]\n        };\n        // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n        var dbResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(dbDsl);\n        if (dbResult.hits.hits.size().asInt() > 0) {\n            dbMap[dbId] = dbResult.hits.hits[0]._source.dbName || \'\';\n        }\n    }\n    // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n    return dbMap;\n};\n\n// 批量查询catalog信息\nvar queryCatalogNames = (catalogIdList) => {\n    var catalogMap = {};\n    for (catalogId in catalogIdList) {\n        var catDsl = {\n            "size": 1,\n            "query": { "term": { "id": catalogId } },\n            "_source": ["catalogName"]\n        };\n        // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n        var catResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(catDsl);\n        if (catResult.hits.hits.size().asInt() > 0) {\n            catalogMap[catalogId] = catResult.hits.hits[0]._source.catalogName || \'\';\n        }\n    }\n    // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n    return catalogMap;\n};\n\n\n// ========================================================================\n// 接口1：汇聚表列表分页\n// 路径: /api/dataassets/convergeTablePage\n// 方法: POST\n// 参数: { pageNum: 1, pageSize: 10 }\n// 逻辑: 汇聚表 = catalog有targetTableId → 关联table获取表名和rowCount\n// ========================================================================\nvar convergeTablePage = () => {\n    // 解析请求体并为可选参数设置默认值。\n    var pageNum = body?.pageNum ? body.pageNum.asInt() : 1;\n    var pageSize = body?.pageSize ? body.pageSize.asInt() : 10;\n\n    try {\n        // ========== 1. 查询 targetTableId 不为空的 catalog ==========\n        // 这些 catalog 已汇聚了表，targetTableId 就是汇聚的表ID\n        var catalogDsl = {\n            "size": 1000,\n            "query": {\n                "bool": {\n                    "filter": [\n                        { "term": { "assetType": "catalog" } },\n                        { "exists": { "field": "targetTableId" } }\n                    ]\n                }\n            },\n            "_source": ["targetTableId", "catalogName", "orgId"]\n        };\n        // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n        var catalogResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(catalogDsl);\n\n        // 构建映射：targetTableId → { catalogName, orgId }\n        var catalogMap = {};\n        var targetTableIdList = [];\n        var orgIdSet = {};\n        for (hit in catalogResult.hits.hits) {\n            var src = hit._source;\n            if (src.targetTableId) {\n                targetTableIdList.push(src.targetTableId);\n                catalogMap[src.targetTableId] = {\n                    catalogName: src.catalogName || \'\',\n                    orgId: src.orgId || \'\'\n                };\n            }\n            if (src.orgId) { orgIdSet[src.orgId] = true; }\n        }\n\n        if (targetTableIdList.size().asInt() == 0) {\n            // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n            return { total: 0, pageNum: pageNum, pageSize: pageSize, list: [] };\n        }\n\n        // ========== 2. 关联查询 table 资产，获取表名和统计值 ==========\n        // 总数\n        var countDsl = {\n            "size": 0,\n            "query": {\n                "bool": {\n                    "filter": [\n                        { "term": { "assetType": "table" } },\n                        { "terms": { "id": targetTableIdList } }\n                    ]\n                }\n            }\n        };\n        // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n        var countResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(countDsl);\n        var total = catalogResult.hits.total.value;\n\n        // 分页查询（按rowCount降序）\n        var from = (pageNum - 1) * pageSize;\n        var tableDsl = {\n            "size": pageSize,\n            "from": from,\n            "query": {\n                "bool": {\n                    "filter": [\n                        { "term": { "assetType": "table" } },\n                        { "terms": { "id": targetTableIdList } }\n                    ]\n                }\n            },\n            "sort": [{ "rowCount": { "order": "desc", "unmapped_type": "keyword" } }],\n            "_source": ["id", "tableNameCn", "dbId", "rowCount", "orgId"]\n        };\n        // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n        var tableResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(tableDsl);\n\n        // ========== 3. 查询关联信息（dbName、orgName） ==========\n        var dbIdSet = {};\n        for (hit in tableResult.hits.hits) {\n            var src = hit._source;\n            if (src.dbId) { dbIdSet[src.dbId] = true; }\n            if (src.orgId) { orgIdSet[src.orgId] = true; }\n        }\n\n        var dbIdList = [];\n        for (dbId in dbIdSet.keySet()) { dbIdList.push(dbId); }\n        var dbMap = queryDbNames(dbIdList);\n\n        var orgIdList = [];\n        for (orgId in orgIdSet.keySet()) { orgIdList.push(orgId); }\n        var orgNameMap = queryOrgNames(orgIdList);\n\n        // ========== 4. 组装数据 ==========\n        var list = [];\n        for (hit in tableResult.hits.hits) {\n            var src = hit._source;\n            var tableId = src.id;\n            var catInfo = catalogMap[tableId] || {};\n\n            var rowTotal = 0;\n            if (src.rowCount) {\n                try { rowTotal = Double.parseDouble(src.rowCount); } catch(e) { rowTotal = 0; }\n            }\n\n            list.push({\n                tableName: src.tableNameCn || \'\',           // 表名（来自table资产）\n                datasourceName: dbMap[src.dbId] || \'\',      // 数据源（来自table关联的db）\n                catalogName: catInfo.catalogName || \'\',     // 目录名（来自catalog）\n                organName: orgNameMap[src.orgId] || catInfo.orgId ? orgNameMap[catInfo.orgId] : \'\',  // 部门\n                rowTotal: rowTotal                          // 数据量（来自table的rowCount）\n            });\n        }\n\n        // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n        return { total: total, pageNum: pageNum, pageSize: pageSize, list: list };\n\n    } catch(e) {\n        // 参数或业务状态不满足要求时立即终止请求。\n        exit 500, \'查询汇聚表列表失败: \' + e.message;\n    }\n};\n\n\n// ========================================================================\n// 接口2：API资产列表分页\n// 路径: /api/dataassets/apiAssetPage\n// 方法: POST\n// 参数: { pageNum: 1, pageSize: 10 }\n// ========================================================================\nvar apiAssetPage = () => {\n    var pageNum = body?.pageNum ? body.pageNum.asInt() : 1;\n    var pageSize = body?.pageSize ? body.pageSize.asInt() : 10;\n    var from = (pageNum - 1) * pageSize;\n\n    try {\n        // 1. 查询总数\n        var countDsl = {\n            "size": 0,\n            "query": {\n                "bool": {\n                    "filter": [{ "term": { "assetType": "api" } }],\n                    "must_not": [{ "term": { "catalogId": "" } }]\n                }\n            }\n        };\n        // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n        var countResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(countDsl);\n        var total = countResult.hits.total.value;\n\n        // 2. 分页查询API资产\n        var apiDsl = {\n            "size": pageSize,\n            "from": from,\n            "query": {\n                "bool": {\n                    "filter": [{ "term": { "assetType": "api" } }],\n                    "must_not": [{ "term": { "catalogId": "" } }]\n                }\n            },\n            "sort": [{ "requestCount": { "order": "desc", "unmapped_type": "keyword" } }],\n            "_source": ["name", "catalogId", "orgId", "requestCount"]\n        };\n        // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n        var apiResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(apiDsl);\n\n        // 3. 收集catalogId和orgId\n        var catalogIdSet = {};\n        var orgIdSet = {};\n        for (hit in apiResult.hits.hits) {\n            var src = hit._source;\n            if (src.catalogId) { catalogIdSet[src.catalogId] = true; }\n            if (src.orgId) { orgIdSet[src.orgId] = true; }\n        }\n\n        // 4. 批量查询catalog和组织信息\n        var catalogIdList = [];\n        for (catalogId in catalogIdSet.keySet()) { catalogIdList.push(catalogId); }\n        var catalogMap = queryCatalogNames(catalogIdList);\n\n        var orgIdList = [];\n        for (orgId in orgIdSet.keySet()) { orgIdList.push(orgId); }\n        var orgNameMap = queryOrgNames(orgIdList);\n\n        // 5. 组装数据\n        var list = [];\n        for (hit in apiResult.hits.hits) {\n            var src = hit._source;\n            var totalApiRequest = 0;\n            if (src.requestCount) {\n                try { totalApiRequest = Double.parseDouble(src.requestCount); } catch(e) { totalApiRequest = 0; }\n            }\n            list.push({\n                apiName: src.name || \'\',\n                catalogName: catalogMap[src.catalogId] || \'\',\n                organName: orgNameMap[src.orgId] || \'\',\n                totalApiRequest: totalApiRequest\n            });\n        }\n\n        // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n        return { total: total, pageNum: pageNum, pageSize: pageSize, list: list };\n\n    } catch(e) {\n        // 参数或业务状态不满足要求时立即终止请求。\n        exit 500, \'查询API资产列表失败: \' + e.message;\n    }\n};\n\n\n// ========================================================================\n// 接口3：文件资产列表分页\n// 路径: /api/dataassets/fileAssetPage\n// 方法: POST\n// 参数: { pageNum: 1, pageSize: 10 }\n// ========================================================================\nvar fileAssetPage = () => {\n    var pageNum = body?.pageNum ? body.pageNum.asInt() : 1;\n    var pageSize = body?.pageSize ? body.pageSize.asInt() : 10;\n    var from = (pageNum - 1) * pageSize;\n\n    try {\n        // 1. 查询总数\n        var countDsl = {\n            "size": 0,\n            "query": {\n                "bool": {\n                    "filter": [{ "term": { "assetType": "file" } }],\n                    "must_not": [{ "term": { "catalogId": "" } }]\n                }\n            }\n        };\n        // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n        var countResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(countDsl);\n        var total = countResult.hits.total.value;\n\n        // 2. 分页查询文件资产\n        var fileDsl = {\n            "size": pageSize,\n            "from": from,\n            "query": {\n                "bool": {\n                    "filter": [{ "term": { "assetType": "file" } }],\n                    "must_not": [{ "term": { "catalogId": "" } }]\n                }\n            },\n            "sort": [{ "downloadCount": { "order": "desc", "unmapped_type": "keyword" } }],\n            "_source": ["fileName", "catalogId", "orgId", "downloadCount"]\n        };\n        // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n        var fileResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(fileDsl);\n\n        // 3. 收集catalogId和orgId\n        var catalogIdSet = {};\n        var orgIdSet = {};\n        for (hit in fileResult.hits.hits) {\n            var src = hit._source;\n            if (src.catalogId) { catalogIdSet[src.catalogId] = true; }\n            if (src.orgId) { orgIdSet[src.orgId] = true; }\n        }\n\n        // 4. 批量查询catalog和组织信息\n        var catalogIdList = [];\n        for (catalogId in catalogIdSet.keySet()) { catalogIdList.push(catalogId); }\n        var catalogMap = queryCatalogNames(catalogIdList);\n\n        var orgIdList = [];\n        for (orgId in orgIdSet.keySet()) { orgIdList.push(orgId); }\n        var orgNameMap = queryOrgNames(orgIdList);\n\n        // 5. 组装数据\n        var list = [];\n        for (hit in fileResult.hits.hits) {\n            var src = hit._source;\n            var downloadTotal = 0;\n            if (src.downloadCount) {\n                try { downloadTotal = Double.parseDouble(src.downloadCount); } catch(e) { downloadTotal = 0; }\n            }\n            list.push({\n                fileName: src.fileName || \'\',\n                catalogName: catalogMap[src.catalogId] || \'\',\n                organName: orgNameMap[src.orgId] || \'\',\n                downloadTotal: downloadTotal\n            });\n        }\n\n        // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n        return { total: total, pageNum: pageNum, pageSize: pageSize, list: list };\n\n    } catch(e) {\n        // 参数或业务状态不满足要求时立即终止请求。\n        exit 500, \'查询文件资产列表失败: \' + e.message;\n    }\n};\n\n\nif (body?.queryType == 0){\n    // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n    return convergeTablePage()\n}\nif (body?.queryType == 1){\n    // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n    return apiAssetPage()\n}\nif (body?.queryType == 2){\n    // 返回当前业务分支的标准结果。\n    return fileAssetPage()\n}\n',NULL,NULL,0,'2084109831678504960','/magic-api/api/08.数据全景/02.数据开放层/03.资源汇聚分页.ms');
INSERT INTO `api_file_t` (`tid`,`api_id`,`file_kind`,`file_content`,`created_by`,`updated_by`,`is_del`,`tenant_id`,`file_path`) VALUES ('81f356ae92fd4116a4d7eb34c43d65e2',NULL,NULL,'{\n  "properties": {},\n  "id": "81f356ae92fd4116a4d7eb34c43d65e2",\n  "script": null,\n  "groupId": "542f981a013646b6b28446891c2b259e",\n  "name": "04.资源汇聚情况",\n  "createTime": 1782955343526,\n  "updateTime": 1784437771669,\n  "lock": null,\n  "createBy": null,\n  "updateBy": null,\n  "path": "/data-collect",\n  "method": "GET",\n  "parameters": [],\n  "options": [],\n  "requestBody": "{\\n}",\n  "headers": [],\n  "paths": [],\n  "responseBody": "{\\n    \\"code\\": 0,\\n    \\"msg\\": \\"success\\",\\n    \\"success\\": true,\\n    \\"data\\": {\\n        \\"pie\\": {\\n            \\"count1\\": 86,\\n            \\"count2\\": 79,\\n            \\"count3\\": 0\\n        },\\n        \\"table1\\": [\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"标准库_重点渔船\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"海上福建数据专区标准库\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"重点渔船\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 295\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"资产数据表(父表)\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"福建省渔船动态监控管理系统mysql\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"资产数据目录(父表)(da_asset_t)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 2167\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"船舶所有权信息\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 127401\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"标准库_浮标数据_目标表\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"达梦_TEST\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"标准库_浮标数据(DWD_DISAS_PRE_BUOY_DATA)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 11\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"基本表_海上船舶\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"海上福建数据专区标准库\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"基本目录_海上船舶(DWD_SHIP_PORT_SEA_SHIP_DTL)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 108516\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"标准库_浮标海洋环境浮标次表层流数据_观测网\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"HSFJ达梦\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"标准库_浮标海洋环境浮标次目录层流数据_观测网(DWD_DISAS_PRE_GC_BUOY_SURFACE_CURR_DTL)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 0\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"标准表_执法案件信息表\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 0\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"标准库_地波雷达观测信息\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"标准库_地波雷达观测信息(DWD_DISAS_PRE_GROUND_OBSERVE_INFO)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 0\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"FBYZT_SJ_BHJQ(FBYZT_SJ_BHJQ)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 0\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"tableName\\": \\"标准库_浮标海洋环境浮标次表层流数据_观测网\\",\\n                \\"datasourceName\\": \\"海上福建数据专区标准库\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"标准库_浮标海洋环境浮标次目录层流数据_观测网(DWD_DISAS_PRE_GC_BUOY_SURFACE_CURR_DTL)\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"福建省渔业减灾中心\\",\\n                \\"rowTotal\\": 0\\n            }\\n        ],\\n        \\"table2\\": [\\n            {\\n                \\"apiName\\": \\"养殖证大屏接口-养殖类型占比\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"totalApiRequest\\": 9\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"apiName\\": \\"渔船区域数量统计接口\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"totalApiRequest\\": 84\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"apiName\\": \\"养殖证大屏接口-养殖区/限养区/禁养区卡片\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"totalApiRequest\\": 8\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"apiName\\": \\"十五个海洋经济数据-柱形图\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"totalApiRequest\\": 8\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"apiName\\": \\"渔船聚合接口1\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"totalApiRequest\\": 69\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"apiName\\": \\"养殖证大屏接口-养殖现状年月\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"totalApiRequest\\": 6\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"apiName\\": \\"大华视频-获取设备视频通道\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"totalApiRequest\\": 5\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"apiName\\": \\"动管-海洋空间、省外船舶、预警信息数量统计\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"totalApiRequest\\": 46\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"apiName\\": \\"深远海设备\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"totalApiRequest\\": 3\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\"apiName\\": \\"动管-省外渔船定位数据\\",\\n                \\"catalogName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"organName\\": \\"\\",\\n                \\"totalApiRequest\\": 3\\n            }\\n        ],\\n        \\"table3\\": []\\n    }\\n}",\n  "description": "说明: 统计资源汇聚情况，包括饼图占比、表格数据；涉及 rm_org_t 等业务表。",\n  "requestBodyDefinition": null,\n  "responseBodyDefinition": null\n}\n================================\n// 接口：04.资源汇聚情况\n// 路由：GET /scene/share/data-collect\n// 业务说明：说明: 统计资源汇聚情况，包括饼图占比、表格数据；涉及 rm_org_t 等业务表。\n// 资源汇聚情况接口\n// 路径: /api/dataassets/resourceConverge\n// 方法: POST\n// 参数: 无\n// 说明: 统计资源汇聚情况，包括饼图占比、表格数据\n\nimport tenantEs;\nimport \'@/common/configData\' as configData;\n\ntry {\n    // keyword字段求和脚本\n    var sumScript = "if (doc[\'FIELD\'].size() == 0) { return 0; } try { return Double.parseDouble(doc[\'FIELD\'].value); } catch(Exception e) { return 0; }";\n\n    // ========== 1. 饼图统计：各资源类型数量 ==========\n    // count1: catalog有targetTableId的数量（有汇聚数据的目录）\n    var pieDsl = {\n        "size": 0,\n        "aggs": {\n            "catalog_with_target": {\n                "filter": {\n                    "bool": {\n                        "filter": [\n                            { "term": { "assetType": "catalog" } },\n                            { "term": { "assetStatus": 2 } },\n                            { "exists": { "field": "targetTableId" } }\n                        ]\n                    }\n                }\n            },\n            "api_with_catalog": {\n                "filter": {\n                    "bool": {\n                        "filter": [\n                            { "term": { "assetType": "api" } }\n                        ],\n                        "must_not": [\n                            { "term": { "catalogId": "" } }\n                        ]\n                    }\n                }\n            },\n            "file_with_catalog": {\n                "filter": {\n                    "bool": {\n                        "filter": [\n                            { "term": { "assetType": "file" } }\n                        ],\n                        "must_not": [\n                            { "term": { "catalogId": "" } }\n                        ]\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    };\n\n    // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n    var pieResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(pieDsl);\n    var pie = {\n        count1: pieResult.aggregations.catalog_with_target.doc_count,\n        count2: pieResult.aggregations.api_with_catalog.doc_count,\n        count3: pieResult.aggregations.file_with_catalog.doc_count\n    };\n\n    // ========== 2. 表格1：汇聚表列表（catalog有targetTableId的才是汇聚表） ==========\n    // 先查所有有targetTableId的catalog，获取汇聚表ID列表\n    var convergeCatalogDsl = {\n        "size": 100,\n        "query": {\n            "bool": {\n                "filter": [\n                    { "term": { "assetType": "catalog" } },\n                    { "exists": { "field": "targetTableId" } }\n                ]\n            }\n        },\n        "_source": ["targetTableId", "catalogName", "orgId"]\n    };\n    // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n    var convergeCatalogResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(convergeCatalogDsl);\n\n    // catalogName映射：targetTableId -> catalogName\n    var catalogNameMap = {};\n    var convergedtableIdList = [];\n    var convergeOrgIdSet = {};\n    for (hit in convergeCatalogResult.hits.hits) {\n        var src = hit._source;\n        if (src.targetTableId) {\n            convergedtableIdList.push(src.targetTableId);\n            catalogNameMap[src.targetTableId] = src.catalogName || \'\';\n        }\n        if (src.orgId) { convergeOrgIdSet[src.orgId] = true; }\n    }\n\n    // 查询汇聚表详情，按rowCount降序取前10\n    var table1Dsl = {\n        "size": 10,\n        "query": {\n            "bool": {\n                "filter": [\n                    { "term": { "assetType": "table" } },\n                    { "terms": { "id": convergedtableIdList } }\n                ]\n            }\n        },\n        "sort": [{ "rowCount": { "order": "desc", "unmapped_type": "keyword" } }],\n        "_source": ["id", "tableNameCn", "dbId", "rowCount", "orgId"]\n    };\n    // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n    var table1Result = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(table1Dsl);\n\n    // 收集所有dbId和orgId，用于批量查询\n    var dbIdSet = {};\n    var orgIdSet = {};\n    for (orgId in convergeOrgIdSet.keySet()) { orgIdSet[orgId] = true; }\n    for (hit in table1Result.hits.hits) {\n        var src = hit._source;\n        if (src.dbId) { dbIdSet[src.dbId] = true; }\n        if (src.orgId) { orgIdSet[src.orgId] = true; }\n    }\n\n    // 批量查询db信息（获取dbName）\n    var dbMap = {};\n    for (dbId in dbIdSet.keySet()) {\n        var dbDsl = {\n            "size": 1,\n            "query": { "term": { "id": dbId } },\n            "_source": ["dbName"]\n        };\n        // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n        var dbResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(dbDsl);\n        if (dbResult.hits.hits.size() > 0) {\n            dbMap[dbId] = dbResult.hits.hits[0]._source.dbName || \'\';\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 批量查询组织名称（ogName）\n    var orgNameMap = {};\n    var orgIdList = [];\n    for (orgId in orgIdSet.keySet()) {\n        orgIdList.push(orgId);\n    }\n    if (orgIdList.size() > 0) {\n        // 从 MySQL 业务表读取当前有效数据。\n        var orgList = db.table("rm_org_t")\n            .where().in("id", orgIdList)\n            .select();\n        for (org in orgList) {\n            orgNameMap[org.id] = org.name;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 组装table1数据\n    var table1 = [];\n    for (hit in table1Result.hits.hits) {\n        var src = hit._source;\n        var rowTotal = 0;\n        if (src.rowCount) {\n            try { rowTotal = Double.parseDouble(src.rowCount); } catch(e) { rowTotal = 0; }\n        }\n        table1.push({\n            tableName: src.tableNameCn || \'\',\n            datasourceName: dbMap[src.dbId] || \'\',\n            catalogName: catalogNameMap[src.id] || \'\',\n            organName: orgNameMap[src.orgId] || \'\',\n            rowTotal: rowTotal\n        });\n    }\n\n    // ========== 3. 表格2：api资产列表 ==========\n    var table2Dsl = {\n        "size": 10,\n        "query": {\n            "bool": {\n                "filter": [\n                    { "term": { "assetType": "api" } }\n                ],\n                "must_not": [\n                    { "term": { "catalogId": "" } }\n                ]\n            }\n        },\n        "sort": [{ "requestCount": { "order": "desc", "unmapped_type": "keyword" } }],\n        "_source": ["name", "catalogId", "orgId", "requestCount"]\n    };\n    // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n    var table2Result = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(table2Dsl);\n\n    // 收集catalogId用于查询catalogName\n    var apiCatalogIdSet = {};\n    var apiOrgIdSet = {};\n    for (hit in table2Result.hits.hits) {\n        var src = hit._source;\n        if (src.catalogId) { apiCatalogIdSet[src.catalogId] = true; }\n        if (src.orgId) { apiOrgIdSet[src.orgId] = true; }\n    }\n\n    // 查询catalog信息\n    var apiCatalogMap = {};\n    for (catalogId in apiCatalogIdSet.keySet()) {\n        var catDsl = {\n            "size": 1,\n            "query": { "term": { "id": catalogId } },\n            "_source": ["catalogName"]\n        };\n        // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n        var catResult = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(catDsl);\n        if (catResult.hits.hits.size() > 0) {\n            apiCatalogMap[catalogId] = catResult.hits.hits[0]._source.catalogName || \'\';\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 补充table2中未查询的orgId\n    for (orgId in apiOrgIdSet.keySet()) {\n        if (!orgNameMap[orgId]) {\n            orgIdList.push(orgId);\n        }\n    }\n    if (orgIdList.size() > 0) {\n        // 从 MySQL 业务表读取当前有效数据。\n        var orgList2 = db.table("rm_org_t")\n            .where().in("id", orgIdList)\n            .select();\n        for (org in orgList2) {\n            orgNameMap[org.id] = org.name;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 组装table2数据\n    var table2 = [];\n    for (hit in table2Result.hits.hits) {\n        var src = hit._source;\n        var totalApiRequest = 0;\n        if (src.requestCount) {\n            try { totalApiRequest = Double.parseDouble(src.requestCount); } catch(e) { totalApiRequest = 0; }\n        }\n        table2.push({\n            apiName: src.name || \'\',\n            catalogName: apiCatalogMap[src.catalogId] || \'\',\n            organName: orgNameMap[src.orgId] || \'\',\n            totalApiRequest: totalApiRequest\n        });\n    }\n\n    // ========== 4. 表格3：file资产列表 ==========\n    var table3Dsl = {\n        "size": 10,\n        "query": {\n            "bool": {\n                "filter": [\n                    { "term": { "assetType": "file" } }\n                ],\n                "must_not": [\n                    { "term": { "catalogId": "" } }\n                ]\n            }\n        },\n        "sort": [{ "downloadCount": { "order": "desc", "unmapped_type": "keyword" } }],\n        "_source": ["fileName", "catalogId", "orgId", "downloadCount"]\n    };\n    // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n    var table3Result = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(table3Dsl);\n\n    // 收集file的catalogId\n    var fileCatalogIdSet = {};\n    var fileOrgIdSet = {};\n    for (hit in table3Result.hits.hits) {\n        var src = hit._source;\n        if (src.catalogId) { fileCatalogIdSet[src.catalogId] = true; }\n        if (src.orgId) { fileOrgIdSet[src.orgId] = true; }\n    }\n\n    // 查询catalog信息\n    var fileCatalogMap = {};\n    for (catalogId in fileCatalogIdSet.keySet()) {\n        if (!apiCatalogMap[catalogId]) {\n            var catDsl2 = {\n                "size": 1,\n                "query": { "term": { "id": catalogId } },\n                "_source": ["catalogName"]\n            };\n            // 执行 Elasticsearch 查询或索引同步，保持检索结果与主数据一致。\n            var catResult2 = tenantEs.index(configData().es_dataassets).search(catDsl2);\n            if (catResult2.hits.hits.size() > 0) {\n                fileCatalogMap[catalogId] = catResult2.hits.hits[0]._source.catalogName || \'\';\n            }\n        } else {\n            fileCatalogMap[catalogId] = apiCatalogMap[catalogId];\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 补充table3中未查询的orgId\n    for (orgId in fileOrgIdSet.keySet()) {\n        if (!orgNameMap[orgId]) {\n            orgIdList.push(orgId);\n        }\n    }\n    if (orgIdList.size() > 0) {\n        // 从 MySQL 业务表读取当前有效数据。\n        var orgList3 = db.table("rm_org_t")\n            .where().in("id", orgIdList)\n            .select();\n        for (org in orgList3) {\n            orgNameMap[org.id] = org.name;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // 组装table3数据\n    var table3 = [];\n    for (hit in table3Result.hits.hits) {\n        var src = hit._source;\n        var downloadTotal = 0;\n        if (src.downloadCount) {\n            try { downloadTotal = Double.parseDouble(src.downloadCount); } catch(e) { downloadTotal = 0; }\n        }\n        table3.push({\n            fileName: src.fileName || \'\',\n            catalogName: fileCatalogMap[src.catalogId] || apiCatalogMap[src.catalogId] || \'\',\n            organName: orgNameMap[src.orgId] || \'\',\n            downloadTotal: downloadTotal\n        });\n    }\n\n    // ========== 返回结果 ==========\n    return {\n        pie: pie,\n        table1: table1,\n        table2: table2,\n        table3: table3\n    };\n\n} catch(e) {\n    // 参数或业务状态不满足要求时立即终止请求。\n    exit 500, \'查询资源汇聚情况失败: \' + e.message;\n}\n',NULL,NULL,0,'2084109831678504960','/magic-api/api/08.数据全景/02.数据开放层/04.资源汇聚情况.ms');
